      "writtenOn": "2022-10-28T05:50:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmmm.. a bit ugly, but perhaps the least worst of the options.\nI can\u0027t find any other place where the build ifdef contains 2 conditionals, and I wonder whether this is good style. Currently this is worked around by using a #ifdef in the file itself.",
      "parentUuid": "09ac77bd_d2a83a99",
      "revId": "13f0e44463d798a32007d81c87f25583a2ad7a93",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
